Package: space.kern0x1b.eidolon
Name: Eidolon
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Eidolon, the SwiftUI API reimplemented on the UIKit of iOS 6, as the demo application
 that xmake emulate installs and that SpringBoard launches; the bundle whose Info.plist carries
 EidolonSnapshots renders the snapshot scenarios instead.
